          ├── Design
          ├── Implementation
          ├── Testing
          ├── Deployment
          └── Feedback
                  │
                  ▼
                 V3
                  │
                 ...

Each version therefore represents a development cycle, not merely a collection of features.

Example: V1

V1 focuses on the Chama foundation:

Chama creation

Members

Memberships

Roles

